<p>3D is not a marketing afterthought. It is how a family or a board approves materials, light and furniture before construction. Photorealistic 3D visualization transforms architectural drawings, floor plans and interior design concepts into lifelike digital images — showing a space exactly as it will look when completed, before a single brick is laid.</p>

<p>For developers and architects, this means the ability to present an unbuilt project with the visual confidence of a completed one. For interior design clients, it means approving the finished space — materials, lighting, furniture and atmosphere — before any physical work begins. Woodex 3D Studio™ produces visualization for office interiors, residential spaces, commercial fit-outs, architectural facades, real estate developments and furniture product visualization.</p>

<h2>What is 3D Visualization?</h2>
<p>Woodex 3D Studio™ is the professional visualization division of Woodex Interior — producing photorealistic 3D renders, architectural animations, walkthrough videos, 360° virtual tours and shadow studies for interior design, architecture, real estate and commercial projects across Pakistan. The studio operates as an integrated part of Woodex Interior's design and build service — and as a fully independent visualization studio available to architects, developers and design firms who commission rendering work directly.</p>

<h2>A Still is a Meeting</h2>
<p>A still is a decision. A walkthrough is a sequence. VR is for when you need to stand in the room. We model from the same drawings the mill will read. Stills first — one still per key room — in-house not render farm — 3D-only is complete — same still can go to BOQ and mill — you are not forced into turnkey — plan holds number — no fake sqft rate — DRAWN. THEN BUILT. See the room before it exists.</p>

