<h2>Questions this note actually answers</h2>
<p><strong>What is a 3D still for?</strong> A meeting. One still per key room so a family or a board can approve materials, light and furniture before construction. Plan first, then still.</p>
<p><strong>Do I need a walkthrough?</strong> Only if the path through the building is the decision. Sequence, not spectacle. Walkthrough and 360 only if how you move through building is decision — Wellstar proof.</p>
<p><strong>Can I buy 3D without turnkey?</strong> Yes. 3D-only is a complete engagement. The same still can go to BOQ later. You are not forced into turnkey. Plan holds the number.</p>

